    "title": "CDC: 2025's uninsured rate stayed flat at 8.3% - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Paige Minemyer ,\n2 days ago The uninsured rate held steady at about 8% in 2025, according to new federal data. The Centers for Disease Control and Prevention released early estimates from its annual National Health Interview Survey, which found an 8.3% uninsured rate for 2025. By comparison, the rate was 8.2% in 2024, according to the report. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
